{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215500/extras/logo.png?t=1726965877\" /><br><br><strong>Welcome to feudal Japan, a world of samurais and danger. In this world, you play as a frog samurai tasked with taking down the snake clan and bringing an end to the war.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215500/extras/1.gif?t=1726965877\" /><br><br><strong>Your agility and speed will be tested as you jump over obstacles, climb walls and ceilings, and navigate through portals. Use your wits to unlock locks with keys and jump faster with trampolines.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215500/extras/2.gif?t=1726965877\" /><br><br><strong>But be careful: the snakes won't give up without a fight. You'll need to use all your frog skills to defeat them and save your kingdom.</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215500/extras/3.gif?t=1726965877\" /><br><br><strong>Join the epic battle between frogs and snakes and prove yourself as the ultimate frogurai!</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Like the wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215500/20590a1ccfcc8227427e5480169f830e7db38509.jpg"},{"name":"First blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215500/5c354e98facc825c5a18361d4f0de4896feccbc6.jpg"},{"name":"A new path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215500/8f5328d5eb22a09856281463a9345e8ee1433782.jpg"},{"name":"Hobbie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2215500/a87016c5dce354f4cc533262541c0d0acd87bbd3.jpg"},{"name":"Collection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im